sequenceDiagram
    participant C1 as Bidder Client
    participant S as Socket Server
    participant P as PlaceBidService
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant E as EventPublisher
    participant C2 as Other Clients

    C1->>S: REQUEST PLACE_BID(requestId, auctionId, amount)
    S->>P: authorize + validate request
    P->>P: acquire per-auction lock
    P->>DB: transaction: read auction/version
    P->>DB: conditional insert bid + update auction
    alt conflict/closed/invalid
        DB-->>P: rollback/error
        P-->>S: RESPONSE ok=false(errorCode)
        S-->>C1: BID_REJECTED
    else accepted
        DB-->>P: commit
        P->>E: publish BID_ACCEPTED(sequence+1)
        E-->>S: event
        S-->>C1: RESPONSE ok=true
        S-->>C2: EVENT BID_ACCEPTED / OUTBID
    end
    P->>P: release lock
